    "One noncanonical two-caption Sylvia-present Day3 Schedule-Done ingress through existing physical and semantic owners; 15 independent semantic groups passed.",
    "Current-line-only manual Save, exact ordered History, independent raw saved Hospital authority and genuine fresh-process Load.",
    "Saved B-only History/line reconstruction remains silent with read-aloud enabled; ordinary synthesized Godot Enter completes through the physical Hospital owner.",
    "Durable Day4 settlement is audited separately from the subsequent live Day4 desktop and a fresh next Solo session.",
    "The settled Autosave still has Hospital route, between_entries anchor and unlock_day pending. The receipt does not claim the saved route is already desktop or the whole coordinator is completed.",
    "Slot3 remains unchanged; the successful reader legitimately updates Autosave/Profile later. Only the separate forge refusal proves all primary files invariant.",
    "Two independent forged-frame refusals preserve exact primary bytes and do not install the forged session.",
    "Cold existing-autosave preparation reconciles missing leases and performs one physical reread; true read/hash/changed-byte failures remain refusals, corrupt bytes remain preserved, and a subsequent explicit preparation is required after a genuine failed read.",
    "Restore ancestry and retained desktop eviction ownership preserve real continuation and day-change invariants without requiring an already-mounted desktop."
